          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#00007f' fontname='Segoe Fluent Icons' fontsize='16'>Fraud cases account for ~25% of total claims, while ~75% are genuine.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#00007f' fontname='Segoe Fluent Icons' fontsize='16'>
Despite being a smaller portion, fraud represents a </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#00007f' fontname='Segoe Fluent Icons' fontsize='16'>material and actionable risk segment</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='73667' id='9' story-point-id='3' type-v2='text' w='89500' x='1056' y='17333'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#00007f' fontname='Segoe Fluent Icons' fontsize='18'>The dataset contains 1,000 total claims, out of which 247 are identified as fraud, resulting in a fraud rate of ~24.7%.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#00007f' fontname='Segoe Fluent Icons' fontsize='18'>This indicates that roughly </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#00007f' fontname='Segoe Fluent Icons' fontsize='18'>1 in every 4 claims is fraudulent</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#00007f' fontname='Segoe Fluent Icons' fontsize='18'>, highlighting a significant risk exposure.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
